    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The illusion of your Invoke Duplicity grows more powerful.</p><p><strong>Shared Distraction.</strong> When you and your allies make attack rolls against a creature within 5 feet of the illusion, the attack rolls have Advantage.</p><p><strong>Healing Illusion.</strong> When the illusion ends, you or a creature of your choice within 5 feet of it regains Hit Points equal to your Cleric level.</p>",
